{"meta":{"id":"data-py-retry-decorator","title":"Decorator và context manager trong Python — viết @retry có backoff + jitter và đo thời gian từng bước pipeline; functools.wraps, with, và vì sao không retry mọi exception","track":"data","topic":"python","tags":["python","decorator","context-manager","retry","pipeline"],"type":"question","level":"mid","domain":[],"asked_at":[],"minutes":6,"status":"done","verified_on":"2026-11-11","private":false,"related":["data-py-gil-concurrency","data-etl-elt-idempotent","sd-timeouts-retries"],"srs":true,"sources":[],"layer":"theory","askedAt":[],"verifiedOn":"2026-11-11","ngVersion":null},"intro":"","sections":[{"key":"question","label":"Câu hỏi","role":"prompt","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Decorator trong Python là gì? Viết một decorator <code>@retry</code> có backoff cho các bước gọi API/đọc file trong pipeline. Context manager dùng để làm gì — viết một cái đo thời gian từng bước.</p>\n"},{"key":"quick","label":"Câu trả lời tốt nhất","role":"primary","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<p><strong>Decorator</strong> là hàm nhận một hàm và trả về hàm mới bọc quanh nó — cú pháp <code>@retry(...)</code> chỉ là viết gọn của <code>f = retry(...)(f)</code>. Dùng cho các mối quan tâm cắt ngang: retry, đo thời gian, log, cache. Luôn dùng <strong><code>functools.wraps</code></strong> để giữ tên, docstring của hàm gốc (quan trọng cho log và debug). <code>@retry</code> đúng phải có: <strong>chỉ retry lỗi tạm thời</strong> (timeout, lỗi kết nối, HTTP 429/5xx) — không retry lỗi dữ liệu hay 400; <strong>số lần tối đa</strong>; <strong>backoff luỹ thừa có jitter</strong> để nhiều worker không cùng thử lại một lúc; và chỉ áp cho thao tác <strong>idempotent</strong>. <strong>Context manager</strong> quản lý tài nguyên có &quot;vào&quot; và &quot;ra&quot; bảo đảm chạy kể cả khi lỗi — <code>with open(...)</code>, kết nối DB, khoá; viết bằng <code>@contextlib.contextmanager</code> với <code>yield</code> trong <code>try/finally</code>. Trong thực tế, tôi thường dùng thư viện <strong>tenacity</strong> thay vì tự viết retry, nhưng phải hiểu để cấu hình đúng.</p>\n"},{"key":"deep","label":"Trả lời đầy đủ","role":"detail","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Câu hỏi kết hợp kiến thức ngôn ngữ (closure, hàm bậc cao, <code>with</code>) với phán đoán vận hành: thử lại cái gì, bao nhiêu lần, chờ bao lâu. Người phỏng vấn thường đào vào phần thứ hai — retry sai cách có thể biến một sự cố nhỏ của hệ thống phụ thuộc thành bão request làm nó sập hẳn, hoặc tạo dữ liệu trùng. Vì vậy hãy luôn nói rõ điều kiện retry, giới hạn và yêu cầu idempotent đi kèm.</p>\n<h3>Decorator retry</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"python\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> functools, logging, random, time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">log </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logging.getLogger(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__name__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, on</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ConnectionError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TimeoutError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), attempts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> decorate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fn):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        @functools.wraps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fn)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wrapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, attempts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fn(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempts:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                        raise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    delay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random.uniform(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cap, base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> **</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt))   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># full jitter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    log.warning(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lỗi lần </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> — thử lại sau </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%.2f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                fn.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__name__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, attempt, attempts, e, delay)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    time.sleep(delay)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wrapper</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decorate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">on</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ConnectionError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TimeoutError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attempts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> download_partner_file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(day): </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>Ba lớp hàm vì decorator có tham số: <code>retry(...)</code> trả về <code>decorate</code>, <code>decorate(fn)</code> trả về <code>wrapper</code>.</p>\n<h3>Context manager đo thời gian</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"python\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contextlib, time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@contextlib.contextmanager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name, metrics):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.perf_counter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        yield</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        metrics[name] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, time.perf_counter() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Exception</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        metrics[name] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"failed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, time.perf_counter() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      # không nuốt lỗi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"extract\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, metrics):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rows </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> extract()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"load\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, metrics):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    load(rows)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p><code>finally</code>/<code>except ... raise</code> bảo đảm luôn ghi nhận thời gian, kể cả khi bước lỗi.</p>\n<h3>Khi nào <strong>không</strong> retry</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Lỗi</th>\n<th>Retry?</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Timeout, mất kết nối, 503, 429 (theo <code>Retry-After</code>)</td>\n<td>Có</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>400, 401, 403, 404, lỗi validate dữ liệu</td>\n<td>Không — thử lại vẫn lỗi</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ghi không idempotent (POST tạo giao dịch) không có idempotency key</td>\n<td>Không — có thể tạo trùng</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lỗi trong code của mình (KeyError, TypeError)</td>\n<td>Không</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Retry chồng nhiều tầng (Airflow retry task × decorator retry × retry của SDK) nhân số lần gọi lên rất nhanh — chọn một tầng chính, các tầng khác giữ ít.</p>\n<h3>Thư viện</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"python\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenacity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retry, stop_after_attempt, wait_random_exponential, retry_if_exception_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stop</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stop_after_attempt(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">wait</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wait_random_exponential(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">multiplier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">       retry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">retry_if_exception_type((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ConnectionError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TimeoutError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reraise</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> call_api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(): </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div>"},{"key":"real","label":"Thực tế trong dự án của tôi","role":"personal","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ngữ cảnh</strong> dựng từ các hệ thống dữ liệu, báo cáo trong dự án bạn đã tham gia (vai trò chính của bạn là Angular). <strong>Tình huống điển hình</strong> là tình huống hay gặp với dữ liệu ngân hàng, bảo hiểm do app biên soạn để luyện cách kể; số liệu là ví dụ minh hoạ. Chưa làm trực tiếp thì kể là đã tìm hiểu hoặc luyện, đừng nhận là đã vận hành.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ngữ cảnh:</strong> phía frontend tôi đã viết operator RxJS retry có backoff cho lỗi tạm thời.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Đã làm:</strong> viết lại ý tưởng đó bằng decorator Python có backoff và jitter.</li>\n<li><strong>Kết quả:</strong> trả lời có liên hệ.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tình huống điển hình:</strong> Pipeline gọi API tỷ giá thỉnh thoảng lỗi 503; mỗi chỗ gọi tự viết vòng lặp retry khác nhau, có chỗ retry cả lỗi 400. Đội viết một decorator <code>@retry</code> dùng <code>functools.wraps</code>, chỉ retry lỗi tạm thời, backoff tăng dần có jitter, giới hạn số lần; một context manager đo thời gian từng bước và ghi log. Code gọn lại, và lỗi 400 do dữ liệu sai báo ngay thay vì bị thử lại vô ích.</p>\n"},{"key":"followup","label":"Sẽ bị hỏi tiếp","role":"next","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Thiếu <code>functools.wraps</code> thì sao?</strong> <code>fn.__name__</code> thành <code>wrapper</code>, log và stack trace khó đọc; một số framework dựa vào tên/chữ ký hàm cũng hỏng.</li>\n<li><strong>Decorator cho hàm async khác gì?</strong> <code>wrapper</code> phải là <code>async def</code> và <code>await fn(...)</code>, <code>asyncio.sleep</code> thay <code>time.sleep</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Jitter để làm gì?</strong> Tránh &quot;thundering herd&quot;: nhiều worker lỗi cùng lúc sẽ thử lại cùng lúc nếu chờ cùng một khoảng.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"traps","label":"Bẫy thường gặp","role":"caution","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong><code>except Exception</code> rồi retry</strong> — thử lại cả bug của chính mình, che lỗi.</li>\n<li><strong>Retry không giới hạn/không backoff</strong> — dội bão request vào hệ thống đang yếu.</li>\n<li><strong>Context manager nuốt exception</strong> — <code>yield</code> không có <code>raise</code> lại, bước lỗi bị coi là thành công.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"sources","label":"Nguồn","role":"reference","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/functools.html#functools.wraps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Python docs — functools.wraps</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/contextlib.html#contextlib.contextmanager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Python docs — contextlib.contextmanager</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/architecture/exponential-backoff-and-jitter/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWS Architecture Blog — Exponential Backoff And Jitter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tenacity.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tenacity — Documentation</a></li>\n</ul>\n"}]}